From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Anthony Fu (via agent)" <reg-github-bot@antfu.me>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 05:33:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): pick a host's name, color and icon while adding it
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Direct connection form only took the address and password, so a new
host showed up as its hostname with the default look until you opened
its settings.

The form now has Name, Color and Icon fields, the same pickers as
Settings → host → Appearance. They are saved on the host once it
connects; left empty, the host keeps its own name and the default look.

Fork-Change: F-19
